<title>FINLAND: ALANDSBANKEN Q1 PROFIT RISES 24 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ALANDSBANKEN Q1 PROFIT RISES 24 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end March,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	13.9 vs 11.2</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			1.8 vs 1.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.25 vs 1.04</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	     11.8 vs 11.9</p>
<p> NET INCOME FROM FINANCIAL OPERATIONS	27.7 vs 27.6</p>
<p> Dividend income				    0.5 vs n/a</p>
<p> Commission income				  8.0 vs 6.2</p>
<p> Commission expenses				0.3 vs 0.2</p>
<p> Net income from securities transactions    2.3 vs 1.3</p>
<p> Other operating income			   1.8 vs 1.5</p>
<p> TOTAL INCOME					40.0 vs 36.6</p>
<p> Personnel expenses				15.5 vs 15</p>
<p> Other administrative expenses		  2.8 vs 2.6</p>
<p> Depreciation					 1.2 vs 1.5</p>
<p> Other operating expenses			 4.0 vs 3.7</p>
<p> TOTAL EXPENSES				    26.4 vs 25.4</p>
<p> Extraordinary gain				 0.4 vs 0.4</p>
<p> PROFIT BEFORE APPROPRIATIONS AND TAXES    14.3 vs 11.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish Aland Islands-based bank is</p>
<p>Alandsbanken Ab.</p>
